  "description": "White forward, the rear body Moroccan red from a curve that falls from the crown over the wing to the lower side at the tail; under it, parted by a thin white line, a green sweep (dark green, bright green along its lower front edge) that runs from the crown over the wing down and aft to a point near the last door. White fin with a big open red ring leaning back and the green star of Morocco's flag at its open lower-left end; the body's red runs up into the fin's lower trailing corner. 'الخطوط الملكية المغربية' and 'Royal Air Maroc' in red on the forward body: the Arabic on top on the left side, the English on top on the right. White engines.",
