  "notes": "Measured on CN-RGZ's left side (2020-04-22); right-side titles on CN-RGY (2023-05-08), and CN-RHA (2025) shows the scheme unchanged. The two sides letter differently: Arabic on top on the left, English on top on the right, each side's top line the larger. The fuselage's red and green were measured on the left and drawn the same on both sides (the right side matches in the photos). A dark grey strip along the fin's leading edge (seen on CN-RGZ) is not drawn. Year introduced not found in a source: 'from' left empty.",
  "history": "New file (Royal Air Maroc had no scheme here). The scheme of the 787s (in the photos from 2019 to 2025); the 737s' scheme was not checked."
